          <a href="tel:5033580443">📞 (503) 358-0443</a>
          <a href="mailto:info@thecustomstickers.co">✉️ info@thecustomstickers.co</a>
          <span>📍 2975 Coburn Hollow Road, Bloomington, IL 61701</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-col">
        <h3>Popular Products</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/die-cut-stickers/">Custom Die Cut Stickers</a></li>
          <li><a href="/custom-vinyl-stickers/">Custom Vinyl Stickers</a></li>
